Subject: [PATCH] Stop the viewfinder in the background and open previews once

Use the existing camera worker to release the camera when its window loses
focus or hands off a saved preview. Keep in-flight captures and recordings
running and remember the selected camera for the return to the viewfinder.

Open the file in the preferred application with one KIO job. This keeps
KDE activation and the MIME association without starting kde-open. Ignore
further taps while the first launch waits to take focus.

